Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.92,0:01:34.93,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.18,0:01:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,[chuckles softly]
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.64,0:01:41.48,Default,,0,0,0,,[CHA] What exactly do you think\Nyou're you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.10,0:01:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I asked you a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.56,0:01:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It shouldn't be\Nthat difficult to answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.65,0:01:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.36,0:01:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,[Jinwoo sighs]
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.44,0:01:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO]\NThat was careless.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.99,0:01:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I should have seen this coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.95,0:01:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I was trying\Nto find my way back
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.41,0:01:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,but, uh, I think I got lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.74,0:01:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,[CHA]\NYou're lost?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.16,0:02:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm,\Nyou're with the mining team.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.21,0:02:03.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, beyond there\Nis the boss room.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.00,0:02:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You should stay clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.92,0:02:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO]\NHae-in Cha.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.25,0:02:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,,The rumors about her were true.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.42,0:02:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't notice her presence\Nuntil she spoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.01,0:02:14.01,Default,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.18,0:02:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,[CHA]\NI swear I saw it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.55,0:02:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Wasn't he holding\Na weapon a moment ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.72,0:02:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.39,0:02:20.93,Default,,0,0,0,,[CHA] You need\Nto leave this place now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.43,0:02:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,If you accidentally\Nagitate the boss,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.27,0:02:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,the entire mining team\Ncould be wiped out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.94,0:02:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO]\NYes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.52,0:02:30.23,Default,,0,0,0,,[footsteps approaching]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.53,0:02:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.99,0:02:36.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.07,0:02:38.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.16,0:02:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,[footsteps approaching]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.58,0:02:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.04,0:02:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,[sniffs]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.66,0:02:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,[CHA] For some reason,\Nhe doesn't stink.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.29,0:02:48.63,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO]\NIs everything okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.88,0:02:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry,\Nbut are you really a hunter?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.67,0:02:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO]\NUm, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.09,0:02:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,[CHA]\NJinwoo Sung,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.59,0:02:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,an E-rank.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.10,0:03:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,[clears throat]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.27,0:03:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Never mind, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.81,0:03:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You should be careful\Non your way back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.81,0:03:07.23,Default,,0,0,0,,This dungeon is pretty big.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.31,0:03:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, sure thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.69,0:03:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,[footsteps receding]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.98,0:03:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,[CHA] Is it\Nbecause his rank is so low?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.61,0:03:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,He didn't smell bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.32,0:03:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,If anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.74,0:03:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,he smelled nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.08,0:03:24.25,Default,,0,0,0,,[YOONSEOK]\NI still can't believe
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.33,0:03:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,you ran into Hunter Cha.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.96,0:03:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure are lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.75,0:03:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Even getting the chance\Nto just talk to her
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.67,0:03:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,is a pipe dream\Nfor people like us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.67,0:03:32.67,Default,,0,0,0,,[chuckles]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.80,0:03:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You laugh, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.17,0:03:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,she's no joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.38,0:03:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Patrolling nonstop\Nin case the dungeon boss
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.84,0:03:38.97,Default,,0,0,0,,goes on a rampage.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.64,0:03:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,She's something else, that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.89,0:03:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO]\NSo that's what she was doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.81,0:03:45.85,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINSOO]\NYou know what I heard?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.98,0:03:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Apparently, she doesn't like\Nthe way other hunters smell.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.81,0:03:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO]\NThe way they smell?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.48,0:03:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.56,0:03:53.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess that sense\Nis stronger for her?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.03,0:03:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You ever noticed\Nhow she's always
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.53,0:03:56.57,Default,,0,0,0,,covering her nose?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.65,0:03:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO]\NOh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.65,0:04:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,But the way she reacted,\Nmaybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.41,0:04:04.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have the scent\Nof a typical hunter?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.33,0:04:07.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, typical hunter?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.79,0:04:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That red gate boss\Nsaid something similar.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.88,0:04:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it because I'm the Player?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.63,0:04:13.67,Default,,0,0,0,,[sighs]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.75,0:04:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Having the system's assistance\Ndoes set me apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.55,0:04:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.67,0:04:19.59,Default,,0,0,0,,what even is the "Player?"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.89,0:04:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,[YOONSEOK]\NYou did a good job today.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.64,0:04:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO]\NThank you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.56,0:04:27.35,Default,,0,0,0,,We'd still be at it\Nif not for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.93,0:04:29.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe we wrapped up
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.31,0:04:30.81,Default,,0,0,0,,before the collection team\Nfinished.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.15,0:04:33.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like you were born\Nto be on the mining team!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.31,0:04:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Unless, maybe\Nyou had an excavator
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.11,0:04:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,hidden away somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.53,0:04:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO]\NOh, man, if only.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.24,0:04:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been doing this work\Nfor a while now,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.36,0:04:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,and I've never seen anybody
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.74,0:04:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,with a knack for it\Nlike you've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.41,0:04:44.41,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO]\NOh!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.49,0:04:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,[clears throat]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.45,0:04:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.58,0:04:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to offer you\Na permanent spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.29,0:04:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be paid handsomely!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.04,0:04:53.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.21,0:04:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid I can't accept.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.42,0:04:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm only here\Nbecause I had some free time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.38,0:04:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.46,0:04:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.76,0:05:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's a real shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.55,0:05:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,But ya know, what do you say
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.68,0:05:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,to coming in for\Njust one more day, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.05,0:05:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,-You need more help?\N-[YOONSEOK] Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.93,0:05:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got a double-header\Nscheduled for tomorrow,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.18,0:05:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,one A-rank and one C-rank.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.81,0:05:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO] My reassessment\Nis in a couple of days.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.15,0:05:16.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I was able to earn the money\NI needed today, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.57,0:05:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, did he say...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.90,0:05:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,There are gonna be two\NHunters Guild raids tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.28,0:05:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,C-rank and an A, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.41,0:05:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,[YOONSEOK] Yes.\NAlthough,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.74,0:05:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,it'll be our secondary\Nstrike team running the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.58,0:05:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You got another strike team?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.33,0:05:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure do! That's one\Nof our greatest strengths.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.21,0:05:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,There aren't\Nmany domestic guilds
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.63,0:05:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,that can dedicate two teams\Nto taking down A-rank gates.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.17,0:05:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO] Okay,\Nwhere am I meeting you then?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.34,0:05:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh. I figured\Nyou'd turn me down, for sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.22,0:05:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Right! I'll make sure you get\Npaid double the usual wage!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.31,0:05:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO] Wh...\NNo, no, I can't take that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.72,0:05:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,[YOONSEOK] Just take it!\NYou work so fast,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.73,0:05:51.93,Default,,0,0,0,,it's the least I can do!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.19,0:05:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,[CHA] Yes,\NI'm looking for a file, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.19,0:05:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,One of the hunters working\Nwith the mining team today
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.40,0:06:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,named Jinwoo Sung.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.99,0:06:01.99,Default,,0,0,0,,[MALE ASSOCIATE 17A]\NThe E-rank hunter?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.86,0:06:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,[CHA]\NYou already know of him?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.57,0:06:06.49,Default,,0,0,0,,[MALE ASSOCIATE 17A] Oh, well,\Nit's just that Guildmaster Choi
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.57,0:06:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,asked me to get his file, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.99,0:06:09.99,Default,,0,0,0,,[CHA]\NDo you know why?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.33,0:06:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,[MALE ASSOCIATE 17A]\NSorry, ma'am, I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.04,0:06:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,But Hunter Sung's details\Nare unavailable.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.42,0:06:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.50,0:06:18.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It's strange, the Association\Nhas a lock on his file
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.71,0:06:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,as if he's a top-level hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.92,0:06:22.09,Default,,0,0,0,,[CHA]\NI see, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.18,0:06:27.89,Default,,0,0,0,,[CHA] The way\Nhe was acting in the dungeon,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.30,0:06:29.85,Default,,0,0,0,,the fact\Nthat the guild master's
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.93,0:06:30.97,Default,,0,0,0,,looking into him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.31,0:06:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,The Association's involvement.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.52,0:06:34.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's going on here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.10,0:06:38.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Out of all of the hunters\NI've ever come across.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.90,0:06:41.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Jinwoo Sung is the first one...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.19,0:06:43.65,Default,,0,0,0,,who ever smelled nice to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.33,0:06:50.99,Default,,0,0,0,,[YOONSEOK] Oh!\NThere you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.24,0:06:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Mister Sung!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.54,0:06:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINSOO]\NIt's good to see you again!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.00,0:06:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.79,0:06:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,[SANGSHIK]\NHey, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.00,0:06:59.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you eaten yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.75,0:07:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,[CHIYUL] Jinwoo!\NGood to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.80,0:07:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,[JOOHEE] Try not to\Nget hurt today, okay, Jinwoo?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.17,0:07:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,[footsteps approaching]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.39,0:07:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,[indistinct chatter]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.80,0:07:09.85,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO]\NThis feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.10,0:07:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd forgotten what it was like.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.31,0:07:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINSOO]\NWhen it's time for lunch,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.39,0:07:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,you should join us!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.81,0:07:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,[YOONSEOK] Uh-huh!\NWe'd love to have you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.98,0:07:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,-[JINWOO] Sure. I can do that.\N-[YOONSEOK] Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.31,0:07:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,[YOONSEOK] All right,\Nfirst up is the C-rank dungeon!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.73,0:07:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,The strike team should be\Ncoming out soon, so get ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.99,0:07:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,[digging]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.57,0:07:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINSOO] Impressive as ever,\NMister Sung!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.87,0:07:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,[chuckles softly]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.53,0:07:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The work just gets done faster\Nwith you around.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.62,0:07:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be nice\Nhaving a chance to rest
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.41,0:07:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,before hitting\Nthe A-rank dungeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.62,0:07:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,[YOONSEOK] The collection team\Ncouldn't believe it either.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.84,0:07:43.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure you don't want\Nto come work with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.80,0:07:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Five times the pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.13,0:07:46.67,Default,,0,0,0,,[sighs]\NI can't, I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.51,0:07:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,-[KIHOON] Excuse me.\N-Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.80,0:07:51.47,Default,,0,0,0,,[YOONSEOK]\NCaptain Kihoon Son.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.68,0:07:53.85,Default,,0,0,0,,[KIHOON] I was wondering\Nif you could lend us
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.93,0:07:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,someone from the mining team.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.64,0:07:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The guy who was supposed be\Nour carrier never showed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.85,0:08:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,But from the miners?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.44,0:08:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't someone\Nfrom the collection team
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.06,0:08:03.07,Default,,0,0,0,,be better suited?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.15,0:08:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Apparently, they're already\Nshort staffed as it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.78,0:08:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,[YOONSEOK]\NHmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.53,0:08:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,If you choose\Nto accept the job offer,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.45,0:08:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make sure you're given\Nhazard pay for your trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.82,0:08:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,[indistinct chatter]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.83,0:08:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Carrying equipment in\Nan A-rank dungeon
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.79,0:08:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,is too dangerous.\NRespectfully, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.25,0:08:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't spend the money\Nif we're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.08,0:08:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,[KIHOON] So, no one here's\Nwilling to help us?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.42,0:08:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO]\NI'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.30,0:08:29.63,Default,,0,0,0,,-[gasps]\N-No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.72,0:08:30.97,Default,,0,0,0,,[YOONSEOK] Wait!\NMister Sung!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.09,0:08:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you wanna die?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.39,0:08:34.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You know how strong\Nthe magic beasts are in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.93,0:08:37.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Even with the hazard pay,\Nit's not worth the risk!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.81,0:08:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO]\NEh, I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.48,0:08:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a lot braver than I look.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.48,0:08:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,[YOONSEOK]\NI don't doubt that,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.44,0:08:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,but this isn't\Na question of courage, kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.07,0:08:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, he only\Njust started yesterday,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.94,0:08:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,he doesn't understand\Nwhat he's agreeing to!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.11,0:08:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,-What's his rank?\N-[JINSOO] He's E-rank.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.36,0:08:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, you should\Nfind someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.32,0:08:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine.\NI'd like for him to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.70,0:08:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,[both gasp]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.25,0:08:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,My name's Kihoon Son.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.54,0:09:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be taking point\Nwith the strike team
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.21,0:09:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,,on today's raid.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.67,0:09:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm Jinwoo Sung.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.42,0:09:08.09,Default,,0,0,0,,The gate's bigger\Nthan yesterday's.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.71,0:09:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,[KIHOON]\NThat may be true,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.80,0:09:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,but it's emitting\Nmuch less magic power.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.09,0:09:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't worry too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.47,0:09:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,,If there was anything\Nreally dangerous in there,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.43,0:09:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,the primary team\Nwould be sent to handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.23,0:09:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO] Six A-ranks.\NAnd three B-ranks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.73,0:09:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,No one here is an S but,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.52,0:09:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,in any other guild
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.52,0:09:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,these hunters wouldn't be\Nrelegated to a secondary team.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.65,0:09:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,[KIHOON]\NAll right, let's get going!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.32,0:09:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO] Their guild's even\Nstronger than I realized
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.62,0:09:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,if they can field\Ntwo teams of this level.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.92,0:09:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.33,0:09:46.59,Default,,0,0,0,,There really is less\Nmagic power in the air
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.67,0:09:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,compared to yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.05,0:09:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.17,0:09:50.21,Default,,0,0,0,,something's off.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.51,0:09:52.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I have that same bad feeling
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.09,0:09:53.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I did when I entered\Nthe red gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.84,0:09:54.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I imagining it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.18,0:09:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,-No need to be nervous, okay?\N-Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.85,0:09:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Kihoon...\N[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.52,0:10:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean the captain\Nand everyone else
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.60,0:10:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,are superb hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.39,0:10:04.77,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as you don't run off,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.90,0:10:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,the magic beasts won't have\Nan opening to attack you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.65,0:10:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm.\NGood to know, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.61,0:10:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,[KIHOON]\NOnce this raid is over,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.99,0:10:14.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll officially make leader\Nof the secondary team.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.24,0:10:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I might not be\Nthe strongest in the guild,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.83,0:10:19.87,Default,,0,0,0,,but I am one\Nof best A-rank hunters around.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.20,0:10:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I can handle this!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.71,0:10:26.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.63,0:10:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO]\NNo orders needed,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.84,0:10:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,just instinct.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.17,0:10:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.76,0:10:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Here they come!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.14,0:10:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.10,0:10:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,[growling]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.60,0:10:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Dungeon jackals!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.89,0:10:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,[grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.06,0:10:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,[grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.61,0:10:49.15,Default,,0,0,0,,[grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.23,0:10:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.32,0:10:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,[slicing]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.53,0:10:56.57,Default,,0,0,0,,My turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.66,0:10:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,[growling]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.78,0:10:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Duck!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.87,0:10:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,[grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.62,0:11:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,[groans]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.95,0:11:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,,[growls]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.46,0:11:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.63,0:11:10.67,Default,,0,0,0,,[KIHOON] Why are jackals\Nin an A-rank dungeon?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.84,0:11:13.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it that unusual\Nto find them in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.63,0:11:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Dungeon jackals are\NC-rank magic beasts.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.84,0:11:20.47,Default,,0,0,0,,An A-rank food chain\Nshould've wiped them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.93,0:11:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO]\NCollars?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.60,0:11:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.69,0:11:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe these aren't\Njust wild jackals.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.94,0:11:30.23,Default,,0,0,0,,[KIHOON] Is it possible\Nthey were kept as hunting dogs?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.94,0:11:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.03,0:11:34.69,Default,,0,0,0,,[rumbling]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.78,0:11:35.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.49,0:11:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO] There's the reason\Nbehind that bad feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.16,0:11:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,[stomps]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.70,0:11:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,[growls]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.13,0:11:50.33,Default,,0,0,0,,[GEONGUK]\NHigh orcs?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.75,0:11:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,[MYUNG-CHUL]\NWhy are they here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.71,0:11:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,[roaring]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.22,0:12:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,[grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.10,0:12:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,[thuds]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.22,0:12:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,[crashes]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.06,0:12:08.31,Default,,0,0,0,,[KIHOON]\NThey aren't playing around!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.27,0:12:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,[yells]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.48,0:12:15.53,Default,,0,0,0,,[grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.78,0:12:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,[GEONGUK]\NMy taunt skill didn't work!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.70,0:12:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's targeting the back line!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.45,0:12:20.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.74,0:12:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,[fire roaring]\N[groans]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.12,0:12:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll have to\Ntry a little harder!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.04,0:12:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,[groans]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.79,0:12:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,[growls]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.42,0:12:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,[SEOKJIN]\NNo effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.67,0:12:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,How high is\Ntheir magic resistance?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.00,0:12:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.30,0:12:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,[straining]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.22,0:12:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,[strains]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.85,0:12:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a powerful one!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.35,0:12:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I can only hold it\Nfor a few seconds!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.98,0:12:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That may be all we need!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.31,0:12:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You who I now awaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.73,0:12:56.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Collect the head of my foe!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.28,0:12:58.61,Default,,0,0,0,,[growls]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.24,0:13:00.91,Default,,0,0,0,,[grunting]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.16,0:13:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,[SEOKJIN] My secret weapon\Ncosts a ton of mana,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.66,0:13:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,but it's worth it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.58,0:13:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,[grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.54,0:13:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,[grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.62,0:13:10.67,Default,,0,0,0,,[slides]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.04,0:13:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,[growls]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.63,0:13:13.63,Default,,0,0,0,,[thuds]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.84,0:13:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,[groans]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.96,0:13:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,[grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.13,0:13:18.13,Default,,0,0,0,,[GINA]\NHealer!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.34,0:13:20.13,Default,,0,0,0,,-We need help!\N-I hear you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.42,0:13:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,One second!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.34,0:13:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We're outnumbered!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.64,0:13:25.47,Default,,0,0,0,,And it'll just get worse\Nif they surrounded us!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.22,0:13:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Spread out into\Ngroups of three!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.10,0:13:28.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.93,0:13:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,[KIHOON] Even one high orc\Nis a match for an A-rank.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.77,0:13:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,So what hope\Ndo the B-ranks have?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.73,0:13:35.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Against this many?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.19,0:13:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,[swords clanks]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.90,0:13:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,[growls]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.19,0:13:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,,[screaming]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.28,0:13:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,[KIHOON] Come on.\NStay with me, you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.66,0:13:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,,[growls]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.74,0:13:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,[Bora grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.29,0:13:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,[grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.25,0:13:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,[groans]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.29,0:13:54.13,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!\NWho's next?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.96,0:13:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.50,0:13:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Try to stay still.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.30,0:13:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.05,0:14:07.05,Default,,0,0,0,,[stomping]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.77,0:14:14.81,Default,,0,0,0,,[growling]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.11,0:14:17.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.82,0:14:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,[exhales]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.90,0:14:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,[orc groans]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.99,0:14:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.07,0:14:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,[groaning]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.79,0:14:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,[choking]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.91,0:14:33.41,Default,,0,0,0,,[squelching]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.58,0:14:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,[thuds]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.67,0:14:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,[blood dripping]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.59,0:14:38.71,Default,,0,0,0,,[thuds]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.17,0:14:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,[SEMI]\NDi-did that just happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.26,0:14:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,[grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.09,0:14:45.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.34,0:14:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,[yells]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.47,0:14:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,[pants]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.06,0:14:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What changed?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.39,0:14:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are they suddenly\Nmoving slower?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.85,0:14:54.85,Default,,0,0,0,,[grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.94,0:14:55.77,Default,,0,0,0,,-[GEONGUK] Push 'em back!\N-[Gina yells]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.94,0:14:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,All the way back!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.94,0:15:00.19,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO] Hate to butt in\Nas an outsider, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.82,0:15:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't just let them die.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.95,0:15:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,[swings]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.03,0:15:07.03,Default,,0,0,0,,[yells]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.66,0:15:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,[slicing]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.12,0:15:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO] No one would mind\Nif I weaken them a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.83,0:15:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,[stabs]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.12,0:15:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold still for a sec, would ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.33,0:15:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,[grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.46,0:15:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,[yells]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.21,0:15:21.21,Default,,0,0,0,,[explodes]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.42,0:15:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,[chuckles]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.71,0:15:23.67,Default,,0,0,0,,[thuds]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.80,0:15:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,[grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.88,0:15:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,[blood dripping]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.47,0:15:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,[Kihoon yells]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.34,0:15:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,[screams]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.47,0:15:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,[thuds]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.77,0:15:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,[screams]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.23,0:15:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,[screaming]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.94,0:15:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,[slices]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.02,0:15:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,,[orc groans]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.44,0:15:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,[shudders]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.99,0:15:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,[breathes deeply]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.11,0:15:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.57,0:15:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,[thuds]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.33,0:15:53.95,Default,,0,0,0,,[panting]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.16,0:15:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,[KIHOON]\NAny mortal wounds?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.54,0:15:59.63,Default,,0,0,0,,[MYUNG-CHUL] No. Nothing\Nour healer couldn't handle.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.08,0:16:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,[GEONGUK]\NWhich is an absolute miracle.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.42,0:16:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.\NDid you notice anything weird
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.55,0:16:05.63,Default,,0,0,0,,toward the end of the fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.09,0:16:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, the orc I was fighting\Ngot sluggish all of a sudden.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.34,0:16:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,That was all your doing,\Nright, Gina?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.60,0:16:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,No, don't look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.31,0:16:15.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I've just got attack magic\Nand telekinesis.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.43,0:16:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,None of the spells I know\Ncan slow things down.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.02,0:16:20.31,Default,,0,0,0,,And all of the other mages here\Nare fire-focused.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.65,0:16:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's some kind\Nof stealth skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.69,0:16:24.65,Default,,0,0,0,,No one on our squad\Nhas that ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.57,0:16:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,[BORA]\NBut, who cares how we won?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.61,0:16:28.65,Default,,0,0,0,,The point is we did.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.07,0:16:30.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.74,0:16:31.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's chalk it up to good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.04,0:16:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,[BORA]\NDoes he think we're stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.08,0:16:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, joke's on him, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.29,0:16:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,All these mages around,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.58,0:16:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,and he actually believed
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.67,0:16:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,no one would\Nnotice him using Stealth.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.75,0:16:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Tricks aside,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.00,0:16:46.67,Default,,0,0,0,,he did help us\Nout of a tight spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.05,0:16:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure he has his reasons,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.88,0:16:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,so I won't out him for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.01,0:16:52.47,Default,,0,0,0,,[MYUNG-CHUL]\NDo we press on, captain,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.55,0:16:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,or is a retreat in order?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.93,0:16:55.93,Default,,0,0,0,,[KIHOON]\NHmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.02,0:16:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,[GEONGUK] This is too risky\Nfor our strike team.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.35,0:17:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We definitely need\Ntwo more healers,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.60,0:17:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,and another three mages,\Nat least.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.48,0:17:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, it's a shame this is
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.57,0:17:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,how your first raid as captain\Nwound up going,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.98,0:17:08.57,Default,,0,0,0,,but I feel like\Nthe smartest move here
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.86,0:17:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,is to withdraw.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.66,0:17:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,,[exhales]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.78,0:17:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO] I get\Nwhat a tough decision this is.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.33,0:17:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,He obviously wants\Nto clear this dungeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.04,0:17:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,But, if he's\Na reasonable leader...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.58,0:17:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.34,0:17:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's fall back\Nfor the time being!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.42,0:17:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,[BORA]\NHm.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.51,0:17:28.55,Default,,0,0,0,,[sighs]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.97,0:17:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,,[GEONGUK] Oh, good. I was\Nworried you'd wanna keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.72,0:17:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I might be ambitious,\Nbut I'm no idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.64,0:17:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,-[gasps] A barrier?\N-[electricity crackling]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.64,0:17:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,[BORA]\NA strong one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.98,0:17:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Wasn't here before.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.73,0:17:42.69,Default,,0,0,0,,[EUNSOO] Yeah, it would've\Nbeen kinda hard to miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.15,0:17:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.61,0:17:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,With enough time\NI think I can dispel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.23,0:17:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,[BORA] Something with\Nincredible magic made this,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.70,0:17:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,and it's still lurking.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.61,0:17:53.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Turning back\Nwas the right call.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.24,0:17:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The more I see,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.32,0:17:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,the more I realize\Nwe can't clear this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.20,0:18:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,[MYUNG-CHUL] This power.\NWhere is it from?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.46,0:18:03.71,Default,,0,0,0,,[EUNSOO]\NNowhere good.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.08,0:18:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,[GEONGUK]\NThe dungeon boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.59,0:18:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry and give me some support!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.50,0:18:08.59,Default,,0,0,0,,-[GINA] You got it!\N[SEOKJIN] Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.59,0:18:10.51,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO]\NA wave of magic
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.59,0:18:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,strong enough\Nfor B-ranks to detect.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.97,0:18:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But nobody could sense it\Nfrom the outside?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.89,0:18:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,[squelching]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.14,0:18:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,[retches]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.77,0:18:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,[groaning]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.85,0:18:23.73,Default,,0,0,0,,[KIHOON] A curse?\NNo! We're trapped!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.94,0:18:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Semi, holy magic, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.86,0:18:28.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Semi?\NWhat are you...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.65,0:18:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.78,0:18:35.82,Default,,0,0,0,,[stomping]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.99,0:18:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,[MYUNG-CHUL] I count at least\N50 of these guys, captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.33,0:18:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.20,0:18:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,-Kihoon, wait...\N-[KIHOON] I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.83,0:18:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,But if we fight them,\Nwe'll end up dead, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.80,0:18:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,[speaking in unknown language]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.39,0:19:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,[ALL ORCS]\N[speaking in unknown language]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.06,0:19:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,[ALL ORCS]\N[speaking in unknown language]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.98,0:19:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.36,0:19:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,[KARGALGAN]\NGreetings, humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.86,0:19:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I am called Kargalgan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.99,0:19:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,My vessel will lead you\Nto come meet with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.08,0:19:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Kargalgan?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.37,0:19:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,That barrier's your handiwork,\Nisn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.00,0:19:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,[KARGALGAN]\NIt is, indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.29,0:19:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I am a proud\Norcish master of curses.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.51,0:19:34.47,Default,,0,0,0,,[KIHOON] And are you\Nthe master of this cave,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.67,0:19:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,or is there someone stronger?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.34,0:19:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,[Kargalgan chuckles]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.34,0:19:41.93,Default,,0,0,0,,[KARGALGAN] Do you truly think\Nany exist who could surpass me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.06,0:19:44.39,Default,,0,0,0,,[KARGALGAN]\NNow, choose.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.60,0:19:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you be killed\Nby my soldiers,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.77,0:19:48.77,Default,,0,0,0,,or will you agree\Nto come meet with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.73,0:19:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,[breathes shakily]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.40,0:19:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll meet with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.45,0:20:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,[footsteps receding]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.62,0:20:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hunter Sung.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.33,0:20:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO]\NYes?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.58,0:20:05.79,Default,,0,0,0,,[footsteps approaching]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.04,0:20:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Since this guy's\Nmost likely the boss,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.87,0:20:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll attack\Nas soon as we see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.92,0:20:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Even with his strength,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.17,0:20:12.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I doubt he can\Nmaintain his barrier
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.71,0:20:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,and fight with us\Nat the same time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.63,0:20:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That'll be\Nyour chance to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.30,0:20:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Contact the main strike team.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.30,0:20:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me\Nyou're planning to die here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.64,0:20:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,,The plan's still the same,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.22,0:20:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,ensuring this gate\Ncloses in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.52,0:20:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Whether we survive or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.60,0:20:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, um, would you mind\Ndoing me a favor?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.69,0:20:30.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.94,0:20:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,[SEMI]\NIt's not much, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.23,0:20:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,my will is in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.73,0:20:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Please take it to my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.24,0:20:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We're hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.57,0:20:39.03,Default,,0,0,0,,This is what\Nwe're trained to do,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.66,0:20:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,but your case\Nis a little different.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.03,0:20:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,So if you can, get out alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.33,0:20:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO]\NDeath breathing down your neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.33,0:20:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,No options but bad ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.50,0:20:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like the double dungeon\Nwhere I was...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.00,0:20:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,abandoned.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.34,0:20:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,But these people are different.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.13,0:20:56.13,Default,,0,0,0,,[sighs]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.21,0:20:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll still hold onto it\Nfor now but,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.34,0:20:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,hopefully, it doesn't\Ncome to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.76,0:21:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,[chuckles softly]
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.60,0:21:08.89,Default,,0,0,0,,[CHA]\NI don't see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.31,0:21:11.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Did he quit mining work\Nafter one day?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.73,0:21:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That you, Hunter Cha?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.32,0:21:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.48,0:21:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What brings you by?\NThought you were off.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.90,0:21:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, um,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.07,0:21:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I was looking for\Nthe new recruit, Jinwoo Sung.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.95,0:21:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,,[YOONSEOK] Ah.\NYeah, he's around.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.41,0:21:26.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Got roped into helping out\Nas a carrier today.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.08,0:21:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,[CHA]\NOh, he did?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.21,0:21:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Then he's inside\Nof the gate right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.59,0:21:37.59,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.11,0:21:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,[KARGALGAN]\NI bid you welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.15,0:22:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Human worms.
